{"id":"833504bc40d11acb","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-word-process-reachability.md","title":"Contextual Rewriting and Reachability","display":"df-word-process-reachability — Contextual Rewriting and Reachability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-word-process-reachability","aliases":["68-df-word-process-reachability"],"display":"df-word-process-reachability — Contextual Rewriting and Reachability","depends_on":["[[68-df-word-process]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§10 p.29 / PDF 38","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"definition-construction-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-word-process-reachability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-word-process-reachability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-word-process-reachability — Contextual Rewriting and Reachability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2c2f80ef5e90c5ab\" href=\"?note=2c2f80ef5e90c5ab\" title=\"68-df-word-process\">68-df-word-process</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10 p.29 / PDF 38"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"definition-construction-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Process}_{68}(\\Omega,W)\">\\(\\operatorname{Process}_{68}(\\Omega,W)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\">\\(X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Word}_{68}\">\\(\\operatorname{Word}_{68}\\)</span>、连接 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"^\\frown\">\\(^\\frown\\)</span> 与过程谓词见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2c2f80ef5e90c5ab\" href=\"?note=2c2f80ef5e90c5ab\" title=\"68-df-word-process\">68-df-word-process</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 是有限词序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z(i)\">\\(Z(i)\\)</span> 是它的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Step}_{68}(\\Omega,W,X,Y)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists U,V,A,B\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\;\\bigl((A,B)\\in W\\land X=U\\,^\\frown A\\,^\\frown V\\land Y=U\\,^\\frown B\\,^\\frown V\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Step}_{68}(\\Omega,W,X,Y)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists U,V,A,B\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\;\\bigl((A,B)\\in W\\land X=U\\,^\\frown A\\,^\\frown V\\land Y=U\\,^\\frown B\\,^\\frown V\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,X,Y)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists Z\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)^{n+1}\\;\\bigl(Z(0)=X\\land Z(n)=Y\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;\\operatorname{Step}_{68}(\\Omega,W,Z(i),Z(i+1))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,X,Y)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists Z\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)^{n+1}\\;\\bigl(Z(0)=X\\land Z(n)=Y\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;\\operatorname{Step}_{68}(\\Omega,W,Z(i),Z(i+1))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §10，印刷 p.29 / PDF p.38，一步关系替换某个连续子词，并不局限在词首。Reach 是有限步的自反传递闭包，n=0 给出 X=Y 时的零步路径。允许空字为产生式的一侧；上下文 U,V 仍确保替换含义精确。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-word-process","status":"resolved","id":"2c2f80ef5e90c5ab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-word-process]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-word-process","status":"resolved","id":"2c2f80ef5e90c5ab","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Process}_{68}(\\Omega,W)$，$X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)$。$\\operatorname{Word}_{68}$、连接 $^\\frown$ 与过程谓词见 [[68-df-word-process]]。$Z$ 是有限词序列，$Z(i)$ 是它的第 $i$ 项。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Process}_{68}(\\Omega,W)","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Word}_{68}","display":false},{"tex":"^\\frown","display":false},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"Z(i)","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Step}_{68}(\\Omega,W,X,Y)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists U,V,A,B\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\;\\bigl((A,B)\\in W\\land X=U\\,^\\frown A\\,^\\frown V\\land Y=U\\,^\\frown B\\,^\\frown V\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}(\\Omega,W,X,Y)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists Z\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)^{n+1}\\;\\bigl(Z(0)=X\\land Z(n)=Y\\land\\forall i<n\\;\\operatorname{Step}_{68}(\\Omega,W,Z(i),Z(i+1))\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1560,"backlinks":[{"id":"4a6560d8fe6fe304","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SymProcess}_{68}(\\Omega,W)$，见 [[68-df-symmetric-word-process]]。词与可达性见 [[68-df-word-process-reachability]]；合同性见 [[68-thm-symmetric-reachability-congruence]]。四元组结构与词求值取 [[68-df-shoenfield-semigroup]] 的接口。$X\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)$。"},{"id":"a757ce838695243e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SymProcess}_{68}(\\Omega,W)$，见 [[68-df-symmetric-word-process]]。$\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}$ 见 [[68-df-word-process-reachability]]，词与连接取这些定义的同一 $\\Omega$。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-98","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-word-process-reachability]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-99","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-word-process-reachability]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-146","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-word-process-reachability|df-word-process-reachability — Contextual Rewriting and Reachability]]"}],"outgoing":["2c2f80ef5e90c5ab"]}